  <para style="h">2 Tesalonike</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ikete rya kabiri Pawulo yandikiye ab’i Tesalonike</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Tesalonike</para>
  <para style="toc3">2Te</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ikete rya kabiri Pawulo yandikiye ab’i</para>
  <para style="mt1">Tesalonike</para>
  <para style="ie" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2TH 1" />
  <para style="po">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 1:1" />Twebwe Pawulo, Silasi na Timoteyo,</para>
  <para style="po" vid="2TH 1:1">Turabandikiye mwebwe ishengero ry’i Tesalonike riri mu Mana Data no mu Mwami Yesu Kristo:<verse eid="2TH 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="po">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 1:2" />Ubuntu n’amahoro biva ku Mana Data no ku Mwami Yesu Kristo bibane namwe.<verse eid="2TH 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ishimwe no gusenga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 1:3" />Bene Data, birabereye ko dushima Imana ku bwanyu, kuko ukwizera kwanyu kubandanya gukomera, kandi n’urukundo mugiriranira hagati yanyu na rwo rukaba ruguma rugwira. <verse eid="2TH 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 1:4" />Ni co gituma mu yandi mashengero y’Imana yose twama turiko twirata mwebwe, tubabwira ingene mwihangana, mugakomeza kwizera kandi muri mw’ihamwa n’ibindi bigeragezo muriko muracamwo.<verse eid="2TH 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 1:5" />Ivyo vyose ni ivyerekana ukuntu urubanza Imana ica ruba rubereye, kandi ingaruka nziza y’ivyo ni uko muzoharurwa nk’ababereye Ubwami bw’Imana, ubwo muriko murababarizwa. <verse eid="2TH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 1:6" />Imana iragororotse: imibabaro abo bantu bose bariko barabateza, izoyibasubizako <verse eid="2TH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 1:7" />yongere ihe akaruhuko mwebwe ubu muri muri iyo mibabaro, co kimwe natwe. Ivyo bizoshika ku musi Umwami Yesu azohishurirwako avuye mw’ijuru mu kibengebenge gikomeye c’umuriro ari kumwe n’abamarayika biwe b’ubushobozi bwinshi. <verse eid="2TH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 1:8" />Azohana abatazi Imana hamwe n’abanka kwumvira Ubutumwa Bwiza bw’Umwami Yesu. <verse eid="2TH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 1:9" />Bazohanishwa ugutabwa mu muriro udashira no gutandukanywa n’Umwami hamwe n’ubwiza n’ububasha vyiwe. <verse eid="2TH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 1:10" />Kuri uwo musi, azoba aje guhimbazwa n’abera biwe, gutazirwa n’abazoba baramwizeye bose. Muri bo namwe murimwo, kuko mwizeye intahe twabashingiye.<verse eid="2TH 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 1:11" />Ni co gituma twama tubasengera, dusaba Imana ngo ibafashe kugira ubuzima buhwanye n’umuhamagaro wayo, kandi kugira ngo mu bubasha bwayo, ishitse intumbero nziza n’ibikorwa vyiza vyanyu vyose biva mu kwizera. <verse eid="2TH 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 1:12" />Dusenga gutyo kugira ngo izina ry’Umwami wacu rishirwe hejuru muri mwebwe, kandi namwe mushirwe hejuru muri we, ku bw’ubuntu bw’Imana yacu n’Umwami wacu Yesu Kristo.<verse eid="2TH 1:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2TH 2" />
  <para style="s1">Kudahagarikwa imitima no kugaruka kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 2:1" />Bene Data, ku vyerekeye ukugaruka kw’Umwami wacu Yesu Kristo hamwe n’ingene tuzomusanganira tukabana na we, <verse eid="2TH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 2:2" />turabinginze ngo ntimunyiganyige canke ngo muhagarike imitima kubera inyigisho womenga zivuye kuri twebwe, vyaba biciye mu buryo bwo kuvugishwa, canke amajambo canke ikete, bibabwira ko umusi w’Umwami wacu wamaze gushika. <verse eid="2TH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 2:3" />Ntihagire uwubabesha mu buryo na bumwe, kuko uwo musi utazoshika kugwanya Imana kutabanje kugaragara, kandi na wa muntu w’umugarariji atarahishurwa, uwagenewe kuzoranduka. <verse eid="2TH 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 2:4" />Azokwishira hejuru yongere agwanye icitwa imana cose n’igisengwa cose. Mbere azokwicara mu rusengero rw’Imana, yiyite Imana we nyene.<verse eid="2TH 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 2:5" />Mbega ntimwibuka ko nkiri kumwe namwe ibi nahora ndabibabwira? <verse eid="2TH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 2:6" />Kandi murazi ko igitumye ataraza ubu, ari kugira ngo azohishurwe igihe gikwiye kigeze. <verse eid="2TH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 2:7" />Kuko ubushobozi bw’umugararizo n’ubu buriko burakorera mw’ibanga, kandi buzoguma gutyo gushika ikimutangira kivuye mu nzira. <verse eid="2TH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 2:8" />Aho ni ho wa muntu w’umugarariji azoca amenyekana, uwo Umwami Yesu azokwicisha impwemu zo mu kanwa kiwe, agasangangurwa n’ugukayangana kw’ukuza kwiwe. <verse eid="2TH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 2:9" />Kuza kw’uwo mugarariji, kuzogaragazwa n’ibikorwa vya Satani, n’ubushobozi bwo gukora ibimyenyetso n’ibitangaza kugira ngo azimize abantu. <verse eid="2TH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 2:10" />Azokoresha uruhendo rw’uburyo bwose kugira ngo azimize abariko baja mu mahonero, kuko banse gukunda no kwemera ukuri ari kwo kwari kubakiza. <verse eid="2TH 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 2:11" />Ni co gituma Imana ibarungikira ububasha bw’ubuzimire kugira ngo bemere ivyo binyoma, <verse eid="2TH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 2:12" />hanyuma kubera yuko banse kwizera ukuri, ariko bakanezerererwa ikibi bazocirirwe urubanza.<verse eid="2TH 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Guhagarara dushikamye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TH 2:13" />Ariko birabereye ko dushima Imana ku bwanyu, bene Data mukundwa n’Imana, kuko Imana yabatoranije ngo mube mu bantu ba mbere bakijijwe biciye mu gikorwa c’ukweza ca Mpwemu no mu kwizera ukuri. <verse eid="2TH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TH 2:14" />Yabahamagariye agakiza biciye mu Butumwa Bwiza twababwiye, kugira ngo muzosangire ubwiza n’Umwami wacu Yesu Kristo.<verse eid="2TH 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TH 2:15" />None rero bene Data, mushikame, mwumire ku vyo twabigishije, haba mu majambo twababwiye canke mw’ikete twabandikiye.<verse eid="2TH 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TH 2:16" />Umwami wacu Yesu Kristo we nyene, hamwe n’Imana Data wa twese batweretse urukundo ruhebuje, kandi ku bw’ubuntu baduha ukuremeshwa kw’ibihe bidashira n’ivyizigiro vyiza. <verse eid="2TH 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TH 2:17" />Babaremeshe mu mitima yanyu bongere babahe inkomezi zo kwama mukora ivyiza mu bikorwa no mu majambo muvuga.<verse eid="2TH 2:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2TH 3" />
  <para style="s1">Gusaba amasengesho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 3:1" />Mu kurangiza, bene Data, mudusengere kugira ngo Ubutumwa Bwiza bw’Umwami bwamamare ningoga kandi ijambo ryiwe ryubahwe nk’uko ryubashwe muri mwebwe. <verse eid="2TH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 3:2" />Mudusengere kandi kugira ngo Imana idukize abanyakibi, kuko abantu bose si abizera. <verse eid="2TH 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 3:3" />Ariko Umwami ni umwizigirwa, azobakomeza yongere abarinde wa mubi. <verse eid="2TH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 3:4" />Dufise ukwizera mu Mwami ko mukora kandi ko muzoshishikara mukora ivyo tubahanura. <verse eid="2TH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 3:5" />Umwami arongorere imitima yanyu mu rukundo rw’Imana no mu kwihangana kuva kuri Kristo.<verse eid="2TH 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kugwanya ubunebwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 3:6" />Bene Data, turabageze mw’izina ry’Umwami wacu Yesu Kristo, ngo mwirinde uwitwa mwene Data wese mugabo w’ikinebwe, atagendera mu nyigisho twabahaye. <verse eid="2TH 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 3:7" />Kuko mwebwe nyene murazi ingene mubwirizwa gukurikira akarorero twabahaye. Ntitwigeze tuba ibinebwe igihe twari kumwe namwe, <verse eid="2TH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 3:8" />kandi nta we twigeze turira ivyokurya tutabimuguriye. Ahubwo twakora ijoro n’umurango, tukaruha, tukabira icuya kugira ngo ntihagire uwo turemera muri mwebwe. <verse eid="2TH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 3:9" />Twari dufise uburenganzira bwo gufashwa namwe, ariko ntitwabikoze kuko twashaka kubabera akarorero mwokurikiza. <verse eid="2TH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 3:10" />N’igihe twari kumwe namwe twamye tubaha icagezwe kivuga ngo: “Uwudashaka gukora no kurya ntakarye.”<verse eid="2TH 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 3:11" />Twarumvise ko bamwe muri mwebwe ari ibinebwe. Bareka gukora ariko bakita mu bitabaraba. <verse eid="2TH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 3:12" />Abo bantu turabategetse tubinginga mw’izina ry’Umwami wacu Yesu Kristo ngo bame bakora kugira ngo babone kwibeshaho. <verse eid="2TH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TH 3:13" />Namwe bene Data, ntimukadendebukirwe gukora ineza.<verse eid="2TH 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TH 3:14" />Mwitegereze neza uwo wese atumvira ivyo tubabwiye muri rino kete. Mwen’abo mubigire kure kugira ngo bitume bamaramara. <verse eid="2TH 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TH 3:15" />Ntimuze mubafate nk’abansi banyu, ariko mubaburire nk’abavukanyi.<verse eid="2TH 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">Gusezera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TH 3:16" />Umwami w’amahoro we ubwiwe abahe amahoro ibihe vyose no mu buryo bwose. Umwami abane namwe.<verse eid="2TH 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TH 3:17" />Jewe Pawulo, ndabandikiye ndabatasha n’ukuboko kwanje, ni co kimenyetso cerekana ko amakete ari ayanje. Uku ni ko nandika.<verse eid="2TH 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TH 3:18" />Ubuntu bw’Umwami wacu Yesu Kristo bubane namwe.<verse eid="2TH 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 3" />
</usx>